contact_test_01_friction.out
Smaller nonmatching cube compresses then slides with friction (mu=0.99)
StaticStructural nsteps 50 deltat 0.02 renumber 0 nmodules 2 rtolv 1.e-8 stiffMode 0 manrmsteps 1 maxiter 100 initialguess 1 smtype 1 linesearch 1
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 4 1 150 151 152
errorcheck
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 16 nelem 4 ncrosssect 2 nmat 2 nbc 5 nic 0 nltf 3 nset 7 ncontactsurf 2
node 1 coords 3 -0.5 -0.5 0.0
node 2 coords 3  0.5 -0.5 0.0
node 3 coords 3  0.5  0.5 0.0
node 4 coords 3 -0.5  0.5 0.0
node 5 coords 3 -0.5 -0.5 1.0
node 6 coords 3  0.5 -0.5 1.0
node 7 coords 3  0.5  0.5 1.0
node 8 coords 3 -0.5  0.5 1.0
node 9 coords 3 -0.25 -0.25 1.0
node 10 coords 3  0.25 -0.25 1.0
node 11 coords 3  0.25  0.25 1.0
node 12 coords 3 -0.25  0.25 1.0
node 13 coords 3 -0.25 -0.25 1.5
node 14 coords 3  0.25 -0.25 1.5
node 15 coords 3  0.25  0.25 1.5
node 16 coords 3 -0.25  0.25 1.5
lspace 1 nodes 8 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
lspace 2 nodes 8 9 10 11 12 13 14 15 16 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
StructuralContactElement_QuadLin 3 nodes 4 5 6 7 8 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralContactElement_QuadLin 4 nodes 4 9 10 11 12 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 1 ce_set 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 2 ce_set 5
SimpleCS 1 material 1 set 6
DummyCS 2 mat 2
# A neo-Hookean solid: C1=2500 and K=3333.333 give the small-strain shear
# and bulk moduli corresponding to E=10000, nu=0.
MooneyRivlinCompressibleMat 1 d 0 C1 2500.0 C2 0.0 K 3333.333333333333
DummyMat 2
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 values 3 0 0 0 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0 set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 2 dofs 1 1 values 1 0.2 set 3
BoundaryCondition 4 loadTimeFunction 3 dofs 1 3 values 1 -0.1 set 3
# The slide is limited to 0.2, keeping every Lobatto slave point on the
# smooth master face; exact edge-exit contact needs generalized feature CPP.
structuralpenaltycontactbc 5 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 pn 1.e6 pt 1.e3 friction 0.99 mastersurface 1 slavesurface 2 nsd 3
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 0.0
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 npoints 3 t 3 0 0.5 1 f(t) 3 0 0 1
PiecewiseLinFunction 3 npoints 3 t 3 0 0.5 1 f(t) 3 0 1 1
set 1 nodes 4 1 2 3 4
set 2 nodes 4 13 14 15 16
set 3 nodes 4 13 14 15 16
set 4 elements 1 3
set 5 elements 1 4
set 6 elements 2 1 2
set 7 nodes 4 9 10 11 12
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-6
#NODE tStep 50 number 5 dof 3 unknown d value -8.60666484e-03
#NODE tStep 50 number 9 dof 1 unknown d value  1.78308283e-01
#NODE tStep 50 number 9 dof 3 unknown d value -2.93797274e-02
#NODE tStep 50 number 10 dof 3 unknown d value -5.36265983e-02
#ELEMENT tStep 50 number 4 gp 1 keyword 152 component 1 value 2.0
#%END_CHECK%
